  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Cyrene Balance Widget 2.2.3 (Animated)",
      "text": "[](https://dsh.market/)\n**New in 2.2.3** — the widget now ships its own font (a rounded handwritten face) and\ncan be switched between that and the system font from the settings panel. The opening\nanimation gained a mute switch for quiet launches. Balance figures are drawn in a pink\ngradient instead of the old blue. Package size dropped from 30.8 MB to 17.6 MB, which\nmakes market installs far less likely to arrive incomplete."
    },
    {
      "section": "Cyrene Balance Widget 2.2.3 (Animated)",
      "text": "**New in 2.2.2** — the greeting picker now avoids repeating the line it played last time (remembered across restarts).\n\n**New in 2.2.1** — the greeting voice can now be controlled line by line: the settings panel lists every line as text\nwith its own checkbox, so you can turn off any of them (or all of them). The old \"帝皇权杖·铁墓\" random line has been\nreplaced, and there are now four random greetings instead of three."
    },
    {
      "section": "Cyrene Balance Widget 2.2.3 (Animated)",
      "text": "**New in 2.2** — settings toggles for the splash animation and the greeting voice (state kept in `localStorage`),\nan idle greeting (20 minutes without input → the widget says a line in a bubble), and the ledger button is now\nlabelled \"Cyrene's ledger\" instead of the whale one.\n\nOn client startup it plays a full-screen opening animation (`assets/loading.mp4`, 1440p / 60fps, ~20 MB, 13.9 s),\nfades out into the UI, and 2.5 seconds later plays \"Cyrene's Greeting\"."
    },
    {
      "section": "What this build does",
      "text": "| Item | Details |\n|---|---|\n| Loading animation | Full-screen `loading.mp4` (2560×1440, H.264, 60fps, ~20 MB) with `object-fit: cover` |\n| Audio | Original soundtrack kept at full volume; **linear fade-out over the last 2.2 s** — the sound lasts exactly as long as the animation |\n| Exit | Overlay fades out over 900 ms, the page fades in naturally |\n| Greeting | **2.5 s after** the fade-out completes, `assets/greeting.wav` (3.58 s) plays together with a short toast |\n| Interaction | **No skip button, no fullscreen request, no hiding of window buttons** — just a plain opening animation |\n| Fallbacks | Autoplay with sound blocked → retry muted; not playing within 2.6 s → skip; hard release at 20 s |"
    },
    {
      "section": "The widget itself",
      "text": "- Character: built-in Cyrene sprite (610×610, transparent, bottom-aligned)\n- Lines: 25 quotes, font sizes 6/7/8/9, shown at random\n- First click: balance panel; next click: a random quote\n- Everything else (sound effects, snapping, accounting, bubble editor) comes from `dsh-whale-widget` 0.4.2"
    },
    {
      "section": "Customising",
      "text": "- **Lines**: right-click the widget → bubble settings; or `BUBBLE_DEFAULT_ITEMS` in `assets/whale-widget.js`; batch via `tools/set-lines.py`\n- **Font size**: `tools/resize-lines.py` (edit `SIZE_MAP`, then re-run)\n- **Greeting audio**: replace `assets/greeting.wav`, refresh to apply\n- **Opening animation**: replace `assets/loading.mp4` (H.264 recommended for widest compatibility)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "`plugin_manager` → `install_bundle`, with `target` set to this directory's absolute path.\nThe no-animation build lives in `../no-animation/` (package `dsh-cyrene-whale-widget-noanim`). Both share the\n`/dsh-whale/*` routes and `$DSH_HOME/.dshw-*.json`, so only one can be enabled at a time."
    },
    {
      "section": "Asset credits",
      "text": "Character: Cyrene sticker provided by the user; lines and greeting voice: user-provided;\nopening animation: user-provided 4K source, re-encoded to 1440p60 H.264;\nupstream `dsh-whale-widget` v0.4.2 (MIT, see `LICENSE` and `README.upstream.md`)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation troubleshooting",
      "text": "The DSH Market installs plugins by cloning the GitHub repository with `pnpm add git+...`.\nOn slow or unstable connections that clone can stop halfway, which leaves the widget\nwith missing assets — typically only one broken character image shows up.\n\nIf that happens, install manually instead:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation troubleshooting",
      "text": "1. Download `Cyrene-Balance-Widget-<version>-Animated.zip` from the\n   [latest release](https://github.com/sailina-afk/cyrene-balance-widget/releases/latest)\n2. Unzip it anywhere\n3. In DSH: settings → plugins → install local plugin, pick the unzipped folder\n4. Fully quit the client and start it again\n\nThe release zip is the same code, just packaged without git history. It downloads as a\nsingle file, so it cannot arrive half-finished."
    },
    {
      "section": "昔涟余额挂件 2.2（带动画）",
      "text": "[](https://dsh.market/)\n**2.2.3 新增**——插件自带一套圆润手写字体，可在设置面板切换「奶酪体 / 系统字体」；开屏动画新增静音开关，夜里启动不吵人；余额数字改为粉色渐变；包体从 30.8 MB 降到 17.6 MB，市场安装更容易装全。\n\n**2.2.2 新增**——问候语音不再连续重复：会记住上一次播的那条，下次从剩下的里抽。\n\n**2.2.1 新增**——问候语音可以逐条开关了：设置面板把每一句的内容以文字列出来，各自一个勾选框，想听哪条勾哪条，\n全取消则不播。原来的「帝皇权杖·铁墓」那句已删除并换成新的，随机问候从三条变成四条。\n\n**2.2 新增**——设置面板里加了「开屏动画」「问候语音」两个开关（状态存在 `localStorage`）；\n闲置 20 分钟无操作时，挂件会主动弹一次气泡说句话；记账按钮文案由「小鲸鱼记账」改为「昔涟记账」。\n\n> 中文原文备份，英文版见 `README.md`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "昔涟余额挂件 2.2（带动画）",
